WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:18.302
We arrived home from our trip to visit the squire's friends a few days later.

2
00:00:19.303 --> 00:00:23.505
John was waiting at the stable to help James settle Ginger and me back into our stalls.

3
00:00:24.545 --> 00:00:27.226
He was glad to hear that James had done well with the driving.

4
00:00:28.207 --> 00:00:30.768
That meant James would soon be ready to go to his new job.

5
00:00:34.764 --> 00:00:37.885
"I wonder who's going to take my job here," James said.

6
00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:41.166
"It's already been decided," John told him.

7
00:00:41.186 --> 00:00:44.347
"Little Joe Green will be coming in to start tomorrow."

8
00:00:45.307 --> 00:00:46.107
"Little Joe!"

9
00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:47.387
James exclaimed.

10
00:00:47.407 --> 00:00:49.428
"But he's only a child!"

11
00:00:51.188 --> 00:00:53.149
"He's fourteen and a half," John said.

12
00:00:53.169 --> 00:00:57.790
"And he may be small, but he's quick and kindhearted and eager to learn.

13
00:00:58.770 --> 00:01:01.071
That's why I've agreed to give him a chance for six weeks.

14
00:01:02.231 --> 00:01:04.412
If he does well in that time, he'll get the job.

15
00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:08.182
He's starting right away so you can help me teach him what to do."

16
00:01:10.985 --> 00:01:13.848
The next day Little Joe arrived at the stable bright and early.

17
00:01:15.009 --> 00:01:17.851
He was just as young and small as John and James had said.

18
00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:22.535
And it was plain to see that he didn't know anything at all about working in a stable.

19
00:01:23.556 --> 00:01:25.838
But he was ready and willing to learn everything he could.

20
00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:31.724
He always had a cheerful expression on his face and a kind word for us horses.

21
00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:38.222
He liked to whistle while he worked, and I enjoyed listening to his happy tunes.

22
00:01:41.344 --> 00:01:46.066
Little Joe soon learned how to sweep the stable, to bring in hay and straw, and to clean

23
00:01:46.086 --> 00:01:46.567
the harness.

24
00:01:48.127 --> 00:01:52.130
He was always quick to offer to help with anything that needed to be done, from cleaning out

25
00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:53.870
the stalls to polishing the carriage.

26
00:01:56.232 --> 00:01:59.173
And he never complained, even when the work was hard or dull.

27
00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:03.676
James seemed pleased with the new boy's progress.

28
00:02:05.988 --> 00:02:09.171
After a while he decided it was time to teach him how to groom a horse.

29
00:02:10.412 --> 00:02:13.774
"You're a little too short to do much good with Black Beauty or Ginger.

30
00:02:15.175 --> 00:02:20.019
I'm afraid you can't even reach halfway up their sides," James said with a chuckle.

31
00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:23.421
"I'll have to teach you on Merrylegs.

32
00:02:24.542 --> 00:02:29.546
In fact I'm going to put you in charge of taking full care of Merrylegs from now on,

33
00:02:29.886 --> 00:02:31.988
with John keeping an eye on you, of course.

34
00:02:33.308 --> 00:02:38.630
Merrylegs has always been a special favorite of mine, so you'd better do a good job."

35
00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:40.990
"Oh, I will, sir!"

36
00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.511
Little Joe said eagerly.

37
00:02:42.531 --> 00:02:44.051
"Thank you, sir!"

38
00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:48.692
At first Merrylegs wasn't very pleased about this new plan.

39
00:02:49.773 --> 00:02:53.554
I heard him grumble more than once about being handled by a boy who knew nothing.

40
00:02:55.194 --> 00:02:57.335
But Little Joe did his best to do everything right.

41
00:02:59.135 --> 00:03:01.976
By the end of the second week, the pony was complaining much less.

42
00:03:03.328 --> 00:03:06.370
He even told me he thought the boy might turn out okay after all!

43
00:03:07.531 --> 00:03:10.333
At last the day arrived for James to leave for his new job.

44
00:03:11.193 --> 00:03:13.175
Everyone was very sad to see him go.

45
00:03:15.036 --> 00:03:18.699
Even James himself looked sad when he came to the stable for the last time.

46
00:03:18.719 --> 00:03:23.502
"I'm excited about my new job, of course," he told John with a sigh.

47
00:03:23.522 --> 00:03:28.245
"But I can't stop thinking about everything I'll be leaving behind here.

48
00:03:29.306 --> 00:03:32.168
I'll miss you and the squire and everyone else here too.

49
00:03:34.216 --> 00:03:39.478
Then there are the horses, and my good little Merrylegs—what will I do without them?"

50
00:03:39.498 --> 00:03:45.041
"It's very hard on all of us to see you go, James," John told him.

51
00:03:45.061 --> 00:03:47.082
"Especially on me.

52
00:03:47.902 --> 00:03:50.303
You've been such a help to me for the past few years.

53
00:03:51.304 --> 00:03:52.884
So I don't blame you for being sad.

54
00:03:54.465 --> 00:03:56.546
In fact, I'd be disappointed if you weren't."

55
00:03:57.426 --> 00:03:58.427
James smiled at that.

56
00:03:58.447 --> 00:04:00.928
"Cheer up though," John went on.

57
00:04:01.784 --> 00:04:04.527
"You're a fine worker, and you'll soon make friends at your new place."

58
00:04:04.547 --> 00:04:07.530
"Thanks for everything," James said.

59
00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:08.871
"I'll miss you."

60
00:04:12.055 --> 00:04:15.498
Then he walked around the stable and gave us all a few more pats and scratches.

61
00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:18.281
A moment later he was gone.

62
00:04:19.763 --> 00:04:23.647
We all missed him a lot over the next week or two, but no one missed him more

63
00:04:23.687 --> 00:04:24.428
than Merrylegs.

64
00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:32.762
The pony pined after James so much that he stopped eating for a few days.

65
00:04:34.303 --> 00:04:37.564
John decided the best way to cheer him up was to give him more exercise.

66
00:04:38.685 --> 00:04:42.706
So the next few times he took me out, he brought Merrylegs along with us on a lead.

67
00:04:44.867 --> 00:04:48.909
The little pony trotted and galloped along by my side, and that did the trick.

68
00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:54.492
Before long Merrylegs was just as playful and cheerful as ever.
